"user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T07:03:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T07:03:52Z","body":"> I think there is a good chance this is caused by [#110330](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110330)\n\nConfirmed, CC @DarioSamo ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507590116/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3543032141","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112555#issuecomment-3543032141","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112555","id":3543032141,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TLmFN","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T17:19:38Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T17:25:42Z","body":"It seems like the only way this ever worked was thanks to the bug fixed by the PR. I don't really see a way to fix this without reintroducing the bug fixed by the PR, and sadly it seems like it's the preferable outcome, so just reverting the PR alone would be enough.\n\nBoth the real time and not real time probes are pointing to use the same reflection atlas. The PR introduced a change where, if the use case by the probe changes, it'll recreate the textures with the correct size and configuration so the quality doesn't stay broken like the PR shows. This ends up causing an endless loop of recreating the texture if both a real time and not real time probe are present in the same scene.\n\nI don't see a way out of this unless we just make a different atlas for the real time probes and one for the regular ones. They can't live under the same atlas with different resolution requirements. That sort of change would be far too much for the Forward shaders though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3543032141/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3543227070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112555#issuecomment-3543227070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112555","id":3543227070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TMVq-","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T18:04:36Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T18:05:14Z","body":"We should probably just decide on either of these solutions:\n- Revert the PR and let the behavior remain broken: first probe to call the function will determine the resolution to be used.\n- Permanently downgrade to real time resolution the first time any real time probe is detected during the rest of the runtime. This at least ensures the behavior remains consistent if the real time feature is used and will make it not depend on which probe ends up calling the function first.\n- Extend the previous solution with an extra layer of management that it should check the entire scene to see if at least one real-time probe exists somehow. If not, it should upgrade the resolution to the non-real time version.\n- Use two atlases: this seems prohibitive as it'd require more logic on the Forward shader, but it'd be the most correct approach.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3543227070/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3545090825","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112555#issuecomment-3545090825","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112555","id":3545090825,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TTcsJ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T05:20:16Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T05:20:16Z","body":"> Permanently downgrade to real time resolution the first time any real time probe is detected during the rest of the runtime. This at least ensures the behavior remains consistent if the real time feature is used and will make it not depend on which probe ends up calling the function first.\n\nThis is what we should do. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3545090825/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3547550364","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112555#issuecomment-3547550364","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112555","id":3547550364,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Tc1Kc","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T13:00:54Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T13:00:54Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112916 should address this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3547550364/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":